{"type": "message", "id": "971114e6", "parentId": "ee5399a0", "timestamp": "2026-10-20T01:15:02.375Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_01a156e045f8749288ff9a3106a4ff92|fc_01a156e045f8749288ff9a3106a4ff92", "toolName": "seg_open", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "case M30 | sequence T2 | shape (i,j,k)=(180, 180, 160) | spacing 1x1x1 mm\ntarget: myxoid soft-tissue tumor\ndisplay: radiological. axial: patient right LEFT, anterior TOP. coronal: patient right LEFT, superior TOP. sagittal: anterior LEFT, superior TOP. R/L cannot be verified for single limbs.\npointing: set-of-marks only. Global marks are integer IDs (3D); edge marks are 'E<n>' valid only in the current view. Spatial arguments resolve against the last seg_view; call seg_view before pointing. Slice indices are navigation.\nlasso/scribble/paint: list mark IDs IN ORDER around the outline (clockwise or counter-clockwise); an out-of-order list self-intersects and fills with holes.\nbudgets: 40 tool calls, 15 model prompts (exhausted -> call seg_finish).\naxial 80/160 | crop full | marks none | overlay none | v0 | tool calls 1/40, prompts 0/15"}, {"type": "image", "omitted": true, "mimeType": "image/png", "sha256": "ab2bada6b41e6dd7a6d1e25493fb42542a7d29b2d32b45b9c501e8433a3d370e", "bytes": 338480}], "details": {"op": "open", "ok": true, "done": false}, "isError": false, "durationMs": 1068, "timestamp": 1792458902375}}
